{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "_note": "Information architecture (spec 14, D21). Seven areas plus settings. Every routed page belongs to exactly one view here; tests/unit/navigation.test.ts enforces it. A view is shown when the viewer holds its capability; an area is shown when any of its views is. Paths are the existing routes, unchanged. 'match' lists extra path prefixes that belong to a view (detail pages).",
  "areas": [
    {
